C key: Dash move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacebar: Special skill attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number 1: Use HP recovery potion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number 2: Use MP recovery potion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P key: Pause</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S key: Status window</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2665<strong>Game Functions (Xbox Controller)</strong>\u2665</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A button: Attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B button: Skill attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X button: Dash move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y button: Special skill attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LT button: Pause</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RT button: Status window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LB button: Use HP recovery potion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RB button: Use MP recovery potion</p></li></ul>",
